---
import LayoutV2 from '../layouts/LayoutV2.astro';
---

<LayoutV2
  title="Privacy Policy | CreativeComplete AI Agency"
  description="How CreativeComplete collects, uses, and protects your personal data. GDPR-compliant privacy practices for our AI Customer System services."
  hreflangAlternates={{ en: 'https://www.creativecomplete.com/privacy-policy/' }}
>
  <main>
    <div class="v2-container v2-bc">
      <a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span>Privacy Policy</span>
    </div>

    <section class="pp-hero">
      <div class="v2-container">
        <span class="v2-eyebrow">Legal</span>
        <h1 class="v2-h2" style="margin-top:12px">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="v2-lead" style="margin-top:16px;max-width:56ch">
          How CreativeComplete collects, uses, and protects your personal information when you use our AI Customer System services.
        </p>
        <div class="pp-meta">
          <span class="pp-badge">Last updated: May 2026</span>
          <span class="pp-badge pp-badge--green">GDPR compliant</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="pp-body">
      <div class="v2-container">
        <div class="pp-grid">

          <article class="v2-prose pp-article">

            <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>

            <h3>1.1 Personal Information</h3>
            <p>We may collect personal information that you voluntarily provide to us, including:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Name and contact information (email address, phone number)</li>
              <li>Company name, job title, and agency size</li>
              <li>Project details and requirements</li>
              <li>Communication preferences</li>
              <li>Billing and payment information</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>1.2 Automatically Collected Information</h3>
            <p>With your consent, we use Google Analytics to collect:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>IP address (anonymized)</li>
              <li>Browser type and version</li>
              <li>Pages visited and time spent</li>
              <li>Referring website and exit pages</li>
              <li>Device information and operating system</li>
              <li>Clickstream data and user interactions</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
            <p>We use the collected information for legitimate business purposes:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Delivering and improving our AI Customer System services</li>
              <li>Communicating with you about projects, audits, and inquiries</li>
              <li>Analyzing website performance and user behaviour</li>
              <li>Marketing and business development (with your explicit consent)</li>
              <li>Legal compliance and fraud prevention</li>
              <li>Customer support and service delivery</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>3. Google Analytics &amp; Cookies</h2>

            <div class="pp-callout">
              <strong>Cookie Consent Management</strong>
              <p>We use Google Analytics with explicit user consent. You have full control over your cookie preferences through our consent management platform.</p>
              <p><strong>Types of cookies we use:</strong></p>
              <ul>
                <li><strong>Essential cookies</strong> — required for basic website functionality</li>
                <li><strong>Analytics cookies</strong> — help us understand how visitors interact with our site</li>
                <li><strong>Marketing cookies</strong> — used to track effectiveness of campaigns (optional)</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <p>All data collected through Google Analytics is anonymized and aggregated. We do not use this data to identify individual users.</p>

            <h2>4. Data Sharing and Disclosure</h2>
            <p>We do not sell your personal information. We may share data with:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Service providers (Google Analytics, hosting providers, CRM tools)</li>
              <li>Legal authorities when required by applicable law</li>
              <li>Business partners with your explicit consent</li>
              <li>Payment processors for transaction completion</li>
            </ul>
            <p>All third-party providers are vetted for GDPR compliance and data protection standards.</p>

            <h2>5. Data Retention</h2>
            <p>We retain personal information only as long as necessary for the purposes outlined in this policy, or as required by law. Typical retention periods:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Client project data: 7 years after project completion</li>
              <li>Marketing communications: until consent is withdrawn</li>
              <li>Analytics data: 26 months maximum</li>
              <li>Financial records: 7 years for tax purposes</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>6. Your Rights</h2>
            <p>Under GDPR and applicable privacy laws, you have the right to:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Access your personal data</li>
              <li>Correct inaccurate data</li>
              <li>Request deletion of your data (right to be forgotten)</li>
              <li>Withdraw consent for data processing</li>
              <li>Object to data processing</li>
              <li>Data portability</li>
              <li>Restrict processing in certain circumstances</li>
            </ul>
            <p>To exercise any of these rights, please contact us at <a href="mailto:info@creativecomplete.com">info@creativecomplete.com</a>.</p>

            <h2>7. Data Security</h2>
            <p>We implement appropriate technical and organisational measures to protect your personal information from unauthorised access, alteration, or destruction:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>SSL/TLS encryption on all data transmissions</li>
              <li>Regular security audits and dependency updates</li>
              <li>Access controls and authentication protocols</li>
              <li>Secure data storage with encryption at rest</li>
              <li>Staff training on data protection responsibilities</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>8. International Data Transfers</h2>
            <p>Your data may be processed in countries outside your residence. We ensure adequate protection through:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Standard Contractual Clauses (SCCs) approved by the European Commission</li>
              <li>Adequacy decisions where applicable</li>
              <li>Data protection impact assessments for high-risk transfers</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>9. Children's Privacy</h2>
            <p>Our services are not directed to individuals under 16. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children. If we become aware that we have collected data from a child without verified parental consent, we will delete it promptly.</p>

            <h2>10. Changes to This Policy</h2>
            <p>We may update this privacy policy periodically to reflect changes in our practices or legal requirements. We will notify you of significant changes by:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Posting the new policy on this page with an updated date</li>
              <li>Sending email notifications to registered users where appropriate</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>11. Contact Us</h2>
            <p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy or our data practices, please contact us:</p>
            <div class="pp-callout">
              <strong>CreativeComplete — Data Protection</strong>
              <ul>
                <li>Email: <a href="mailto:info@creativecomplete.com">info@creativecomplete.com</a></li>
                <li>Website: creativecomplete.com</li>
                <li>Response time: within 48 hours</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <p>You also have the right to lodge a complaint with your local data protection authority (in Slovenia: the Information Commissioner — <a href="https://www.ip-rs.si" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">ip-rs.si</a>).</p>

          </article>

          <aside class="pp-aside">
            <div class="pp-aside__card">
              <div class="pp-aside__title">Quick links</div>
              <ul class="pp-aside__links">
                <li><a href="/terms-of-use/">Terms of Use</a></li>
                <li><a href="/contact/">Contact us</a></li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="pp-aside__card" style="margin-top:16px">
              <div class="pp-aside__title">Privacy questions?</div>
              <p class="pp-aside__text">Our DPO is available to help you understand your data rights.</p>
              <a href="/contact/" class="v2-btn v2-btn-primary" style="height:40px;font-size:13px;margin-top:16px;justify-content:center;width:100%">
                Contact our DPO
              </a>
            </div>
          </aside>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</LayoutV2>

<style lang="scss">
  .v2-bc {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding-top: 24px;
    padding-bottom: 8px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    color: var(--fg-2);
    a { color: var(--fg-2); &:hover { color: var(--c1-light); } }
  }

  .pp-hero {
    padding: 48px 0 40px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .pp-meta {
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: 24px;
  }

  .pp-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    height: 26px;
    padding: 0 12px;
    border-radius: 99px;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    letter-spacing: .06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    background: var(--glass);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    color: var(--fg-2);

    &--green {
      background: rgba(34,197,94,.08);
      border-color: rgba(34,197,94,.25);
      color: #4ade80;
    }
  }

  .pp-body {
    padding: 64px 0 96px;
  }

  .pp-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 260px;
    gap: 64px;
    align-items: start;

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 40px;
    }
  }

  .pp-article {
    min-width: 0;
  }

  /* v2-prose typography */
  .v2-prose {
    color: var(--fg-1);
    line-height: 1.75;

    h2 {
      font-size: clamp(18px, 2vw, 22px);
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--fg-0);
      margin: 2.4em 0 .6em;
      padding-bottom: .5em;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);

      &:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
    }

    h3 {
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--fg-0);
      margin: 1.6em 0 .4em;
    }

    p { margin: .8em 0; }

    ul {
      padding-left: 1.4em;
      margin: .8em 0;
      li { margin: .3em 0; }
    }

    a {
      color: var(--c1-light);
      text-decoration: none;
      &:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
    }

    strong { color: var(--fg-0); }
  }

  .pp-callout {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--c1);
    border-radius: var(--r-sm);
    padding: 20px 24px;
    margin: 1.4em 0;

    strong {
      display: block;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--fg-0);
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    p, ul { margin: .5em 0; }
  }

  /* Sidebar */
  .pp-aside {
    position: sticky;
    top: 96px;

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      position: static;
      order: -1;
    }
  }

  .pp-aside__card {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--r-xl);
    padding: 24px;
  }

  .pp-aside__title {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    letter-spacing: .1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--fg-2);
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .pp-aside__links {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;

    a {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: var(--fg-1);
      text-decoration: none;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;

      &::before {
        content: '→';
        color: var(--c1-light);
        font-size: 12px;
      }

      &:hover { color: var(--c1-light); }
    }
  }

  .pp-aside__text {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--fg-2);
    line-height: 1.55;
    margin: 0;
  }
</style>
